Description:

ContactCard/set now rejects name and address components that lack a kind
or a value, which a component with an unknown property used to bypass.
Such components already stored are dropped when the card is read, so a
text query no longer crashes on them.


Documentation:

None.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

None.  Cards stored with such components are repaired the next time they
are updated; the server logs jscontact.components.dropped for each one read.


GitHub issue:

None.
